      "width": 1280,
      "height": 150,
      "content": "TODAY — measured on post 3406920 at 1440×900\nThe sidebar (event card, presets, stickers, actions) fills the viewport before 'Resource Reviews' begins. The column is sticky but taller than the viewport, so cards are cut off at either end; the comment editor is about 270px wide. On a phone the reviews start 8.7 screens down on a 5-image post."
