      "width": 1280,
      "height": 150,
      "content": "D · WRITING A REVIEW — the stepper\nOpened by the pencil on a resource row, or by 'Review the rest' in the progress card. One resource at a time: a full-width editor, the post images that used it, Recommend / Not for me, Save & next. The left list jumps to any resource and shows what is done. Full screen on a phone, with the list as a '4 of 12' picker."
