      "name": "Row label · D · RATE IN THE RESOURCES PANEL",
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 170,
      "content": "D · RATE IN EACH IMAGE'S RESOURCES PANEL (chosen direction)\nThe thumbs go on the Resources panel rows every image card already has; rating a resource once rates it everywhere in the post. The pencil opens the review stepper (next row) on that resource. The sidebar review list goes away; a two-line progress card sits under Publish with 'Review the rest' and 'Next unrated'. Mobile needs nothing extra because the panel lives in the main column."
